---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Reinhard Moosauer | m1b.de"
  description="Background on Reinhard Moosauer, Moosauer IT Consulting, ZEISS Optotechnik, and Software Engineering."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 space-y-12">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="border-b border-slate-800 pb-8 space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-950 text-brand-300 text-xs font-mono border border-brand-800/50">
        <span>Profile</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-100 tracking-tight">
        About Reinhard Moosauer & m1b.de
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 font-light leading-relaxed">
        Software Developer, System Architect, and Expert in Application Development & Industrial Automation.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Profile Content -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      
      <!-- Bio text -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-6 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 font-mono">
          Moosauer IT Consulting (2000 – 2013)
        </h2>
        <p>
          Under the name <strong>Moosauer IT Beratung</strong> (Moosauer IT Consulting), I worked independently from 2000 to 2013 across a variety of IT projects, software architecture, and client consulting engagements. Key focus areas included developing tailored enterprise solutions, database architectures, and system integrations.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 font-mono">
          Optical Metrology & Automation
        </h2>
        <p>
          In my current role at <strong>ZEISS Optotechnik GmbH</strong>, I focus on developing complex software solutions in the field of optical 3D sensor technology, robot control (primarily in C# and .NET), and high-performance data processing.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 font-mono">
          Technology Stack & Interests
        </h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-slate-300">
          <li><strong>Programming Languages:</strong> C#, TypeScript, C++, SQL, Bash</li>
          <li><strong>Frameworks & Tools:</strong> .NET / .NET Core, Astro, Node.js, Docker, Git</li>
          <li><strong>DevOps & CI/CD:</strong> GitHub Actions, Automated Testing, Cloud Deployments</li>
          <li><strong>Application Domains:</strong> Industry 4.0, Robot Control, 3D Metrology, Jamstack</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Sidebar Info Card -->
      <aside class="space-y-6">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 space-y-4">
          <div class="w-20 h-20 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-500 to-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-2xl text-white font-mono shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/20">
            RM
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-100">Reinhard Moosauer</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">Software Engineer</p>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-800 space-y-3 text-xs">
            <div>
              <span class="text-slate-400 font-mono">Email:</span>
              <p class="text-brand-300 font-mono font-medium">office@moosauer.de</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="text-slate-400 font-mono">GitHub:</span>
              <p class="text-brand-300 font-mono font-medium">
                <a href="https://github.com/moses70" target="_blank" class="hover:underline">github.com/moses70</a>
              </p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="text-slate-400 font-mono">Location:</span>
              <p class="text-slate-200">Germany</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>

    </div>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
